Id: squid002w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_squid
Fix: Keep Safe_ports to what clients need, and http_access deny !Safe_ports.
References: squid.conf.documented
Controls: CIS 4.4; NIST SC-7; ISO 8.20; CE Firewalls

The proxy restricts no ports: it connects anywhere, mail
submission among it. Deny what is not a safe port first, with the
Safe_ports ACL holding only what clients need.
